  <name>Photo</name>
  <summary>View and edit images</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.hugomonizdorego">
    <name>Selviana DE Project</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>Photo views and edits one image at a time: read its camera details and location, rotate, crop, resize, adjust the colours and apply filters.</p>
    <p>Draw on photos with a smooth pen, a highlighter, arrows, lines, rectangles, ellipses and text, and blur or pixelate private details. Drawings stay editable until you save, and are then flattened into the image at full resolution, keeping the camera details.</p>
    <p>Albums, favorites, slideshows and import live in Gallery.</p>
    <p>Part of the Selviana Desktop Environment, developed by the Selviana DE Project.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">sde-view.desktop</launchable>
